        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For Zig-Zag Products, we have also developed a growing e-commerce business along with a sales team focused on serving alternative channels such as headshops and dispensaries.",
        "start_character": 38610,
        "end_character": 38784
      },
      {
