        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Stoker’s products (“Stoker’s”) segment, we (i) manufacture and market moist snuff tobacco (“MST”), (ii) contract for and market FRE® and ALP®, our modern oral products, and (iii) contract for and market loose-leaf chewing tobacco products.",
