        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the leadership of a senior management team with extensive experience in the consumer products, alternative smoking accessories and tobacco industries, we have grown and diversified our business through new product launches, category expansions, and acquisitions while concurrently improving operational efficiency.",
